--------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. DEFINITIONS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

"Software" means the MATLAB source code, scripts, and associated lookup-table
files contained in this repository, which provide a representative
implementation for simulating the population-based in vitro transcription
model for the 12-nucleotide RNA construct considered in Case Study II of
the associated publication, together with the documentation accompanying
them and any modification of or derivative work based on any of the
foregoing.

"Non-Commercial Use" means use for academic research, teaching, private
study or internal evaluation, where that use is not intended for or
directed towards commercial advantage or monetary compensation. For the
avoidance of doubt, the following are NOT Non-Commercial Use: use by or on
behalf of a commercial entity; use in providing a service for which a fee
is charged; and use in the development, validation, manufacture or
regulatory approval of any product or service offered or intended to be
offered for sale. Use carried out under a research agreement funded by a
commercial entity is not Non-Commercial Use unless that agreement expressly
provides otherwise.

"Licensor" means the University of Sheffield.

